    "desc": "Displays the claim paid amount and the claim billed amount per quarter. \n•\tPlacing the mouse over this widget will display the total amount paid or billed per quarter. \n•\tTo view information for a specific quarter, select the desired line and quarter on the widget. The widgets will adjust to reflect information for that specific paid/billed amount and quarter only. The Percent Paid Vs. Percent Billed will also adjust per quarter. Utilizing filter features will only affect that user’s view.\n•\tTo filter all corresponding widgets by grouped selection, left click and drag across the desired information. Click select. All correlating widgets will adjust.\n•\tTo clear the filter from a widget, select clear selection. To restore the work session dashboard and clear any filters, select the options icon located at the top right corner of the dialog. Select Restore Dashboard.",
